{"unit_id":"TussalZeus18028__dsh-open-folder#card-zh","repo":"TussalZeus18028/dsh-open-folder","commit":"47f3d0713d86451dfb4a3763eb67171dc49dd9d8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-open-folder 是 DSH 网页插件，会在工作区侧边栏的会话行菜单中加入打开文件夹入口。它根据会话和工作区信息解析对应目录，并通过宿主端点或内置路径接口调用系统文件管理器；设置页还提供打开状态诊断、通知选项和导航滚动条修复。适合希望从会话列表快速查看项目目录的 DSH 网页用户。使用时需要运行在支持本机路径打开的 DSH web 宿主中。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:685-763","lib/index.js:73-123"]}
{"unit_id":"TussalZeus18028__dsh-open-folder#card-en","repo":"TussalZeus18028/dsh-open-folder","commit":"47f3d0713d86451dfb4a3763eb67171dc49dd9d8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-open-folder adds an Open folder action to DSH web session menus. It resolves a session's workspace and asks the host file manager to open it, with RPC fallback. Settings provide diagnostics, notification controls, and a navigation scrollbar fix. The host must support local path opening.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:685-763","lib/index.js:73-123"]}
